Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straightzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give you a choice on\Nhow you want to meet your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will it be plain old sunlight or Hamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I could just smash in your brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you feel about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, would you lose your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take a small fortune to\Nfix everything in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.78,0:00:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just shot a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Person?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean straighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bullets I fired at him\Nall have strange dents in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been completely warped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smokey, get out of here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing I shot, I can only\Nhope that he was a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he was, I'll happily go to jail\Nwithout thinking twice about it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else would he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we please stop the crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to think here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't calm down, I may\Nhave to make out with you.
