Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.38,0:01:52.59,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.38,0:01:52.59,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.59,0:01:55.97,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.59,0:01:55.97,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:01:55.97,0:02:03.23,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.97,0:02:03.23,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.98,0:02:09.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.98,0:02:09.78,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries in it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.98,0:02:09.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.78,0:02:18.49,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.78,0:02:18.49,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.49,0:02:24.58,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.49,0:02:24.58,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.38,0:02:31.21,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.38,0:02:31.21,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.21,0:02:35.05,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.21,0:02:35.05,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.05,0:02:40.47,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.05,0:02:40.47,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions coursing through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.31,0:02:43.56,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.31,0:02:43.56,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.81,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.81,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.81,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.81,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.81,0:02:49.65,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.81,0:02:49.65,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.65,0:02:55.45,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.65,0:02:55.45,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.45,0:03:00.49,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.45,0:03:00.49,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close.
