Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's failure was in his\Ninfatuation with his own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just couldn't resist\Nconstantly pushing his own limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stretched himself thin,\Nallowing Jonathan to strike him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have a different philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figure I'll have plenty\Nof time to reflect on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the extent of my powers\Nafter you're destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be no mercy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be\Nappropriate to open up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the technique that\NDio used to kill Jonathan.
