Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a little too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the only one left is Arena Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you'll say next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About as easy as taking candy from a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next thing you'll say is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he possibly be alive\Nwith that hole in his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how could he possibly be\Nalive with that hole in his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too much time meditating out in the\NTibetan boonies has dulled your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I like this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It keeps you sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be so confused right now if\Nyou had just been a bit more observant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, here's a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to\Nhave the time, would you?
