Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as though I never\Neven touched him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be possible\Nthat Granny was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Granny was not wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I can see that\Nyou would grow into quite
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a worthy foe if I didn't\Nhave to kill you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a secret before you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is an insect deep in Southeast\NAsia called the Sariporosia beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirty thousand of\Ntheir tiny stomachs have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been dried out and then\Nwoven into this scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their bodies conduct Harmon\Nfar better than a human body,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thus dispersing the charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's similar to an electrical ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have inherited 4,000 years worth of\Nhistory and research in the art of Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike Dio, I have studied the craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a master of its strengths\Nand flaws in all forms of combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's quite impressive.\NNo, really? It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But did you think I'd completely rely on\Na gimmick like Harmon all of the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm hmm. I'm also very fast. What how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you pin that grenade on my scarf
