Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I and you Should take a look at\Nthe grenade you just knocked away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You son of a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smokey, I thought I told you to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, God, I promise I won't\Never do anything bad again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No stealing, no lying, I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just save me.
