Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.45,0:08:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably kill monsters all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.09,0:08:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, of course I do. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you would! Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a secret weapon for\Nsituations such as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A secret weapon? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at his legs, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I basically blew them to smithereens,\Nand they still haven't fully healed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our ticket then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do his legs have\Nto do with your weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs are in great shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you going to do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run as fast as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make way! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, follow me, straight zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make him pay dearly for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll take some time to regenerate\Nafter what he did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a perfect scoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The papers will be falling\Nall over themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my chance to break\Ninto big-time journalism.
