Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's behind me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be safe by now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I hear what, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I hear is the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that. Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He followed us here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Jojo, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would not do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away and I'll kill her right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But come up and meet me,\Nand I will let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of threat is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know who\Nthat woman is, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether you know this woman\Nor not is inconsequential.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you flee now, I'll know\Njust what sort of man you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rather than pursue you, I could\Nuse this time to heal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a true coward would not seek\Nrevenge for Speedwagon. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you were to come up here\Nafter a girl you don't even know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll see that you\Nare both courageous and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Powerful, which means you'll\Npresent a real threat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and continue to pursue me into the\Nfuture and I would therefore have to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eliminate you here and now I'll kill
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her regardless fight me or run decide?
