Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and do what you think\Nyou need to do, straightzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't fight for that floozy\Neven if I was married to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you certain that this is the\Ntype of game you wish to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be so easy to\Ntear through her neck and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,open up her chest cavity\Nwith just two fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true master of Tibetan Hamon\Nwould never do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such gratuitous cruelty would be unseemly.
