Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a vile inhuman abomination!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your act of playing it calm belies\Nthe fire that we see in you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's skip the pretty speeches!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool me once, then shame on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately for you, straight-so,\Nyou'll never be able to fool me twice!
