Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you'll say that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I deflected your shot with\Na little Hamon shot glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was pretty sure you'd\Ngo for my forehead again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Predictability can be\Nquite the fatal flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give my best to Speedwagon and Howl!
