Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you try to save me from falling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you frightened that I still possess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough power in me to\Nblow your arm clean off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just pummel you into\Nfertilizer with my remaining arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want some answers, Straightaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why did you throw\NSpeedwagon's body into the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something here just doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph, your grandfather\NJonathan's blood flows through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the outside, you appear to be opposites,\Nbut you're both insatiably curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it is my pleasure\Nto warn you that your nature
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has trapped you in a fate\Nyou cannot hope to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you shall learn of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the Pillar Man, and then you shall\Nfinally come face to face with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done decoding your\Nrubbish straight, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I threw the bodies into\Nthe river because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.10,0:14:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see, fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pillar sucked deeply of the\Nblood from those bodies in the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like a plant ravenously\Ndrawing in nutrients.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was ghastly, so I\Ndragged the bodies outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:15:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have no doubts now that he will\Nsoon awaken from his 2,000-year slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is fated that you\Nshall meet him very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when that time comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you shall learn his identity and\Nthe true meaning of evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your destiny has already been written.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Harmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means you must have been\Ncreating Harmon inside your own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing I regret.\NJoseph, all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I planned on entering hell\Nwhile still vibrant and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,filled with energy not as some\Nwithered desiccated corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.82,0:15:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell you the ecstasy that\NI have felt in being young again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straits are wait not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know more
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell to you Jojo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:15:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
