Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1938, the second world war rages,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,threatening to engulf more\Nnations around the globe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with each passing day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the German army grows, it seeks\Nto conquer the world with technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and weapons that stand at\Nthe very edge of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, they also research astrology,\Nsorcery, alchemy, and psychic powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seek to gain advantages\Nthrough every manner
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,imaginable in their quest\Nfor global domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was through this\Ntenacity that one of their spy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.43,0:16:38.31,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Already the events that transpired with Straizo were known by their agents in Mexico. {I dont know if I should put this line on the top to make room for "Mexico", or split it, or what -Fadeout4} {Put it on top}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.43,0:16:38.31,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Already the events that transpired with Straits were known by their agents in Mexico. {I dont know if I should put this line on the top to make room for "Mexico", or split it, or what -Fadeout4} {Put it on top}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.10,0:16:38.10,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\fs67\fad(700,700)\pos(960,815)\bord3\blur2}Mexico
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.10,0:16:38.10,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fs(67)\fad(700,700)\pos(960,815)}Mexico
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,networks in Mexico caught\Nwind of Straitzo's actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so terribly sorry, Major von Stroheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand, it just slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lick it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drew blood from me, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me order you to\Nlick my wound clean. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gently now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you wouldn't want to hurt me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slowly now, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the pain is going away. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cut your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon my interruption,\NMajor von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man found on the\Nbank of the Rio Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.28,0:17:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is now awake, Major von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we interrogate, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to escort you home, huh?
