Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.29,0:17:44.33,SFXBlue6,33,0,0,0,,{=149}{\bord12.71\fscx165.27\fscy127.13\alpha&HBB&\frz9.817\pos(1062.43,58.5)}Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the hell did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve calling\Nme a floozy, you big brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think you\Nare anyway, huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said that you would never\Nfight for a floozy like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:17:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just happened, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure it just happens\Nevery time you talk about a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mouth okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the adrenaline\Nfrom her fear just wore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to find out about this\Npillar man Straizo was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, Speedwagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a saying in\NEurope that comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.82,0:18:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village in which the elderly kill\Neach other is not long for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a secret, a secret that is\Nvery dangerous and could kill us all.
