Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.18,0:19:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There appears to be a man\Ntrapped inside this pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We extracted it from the location\Nwe got from you. Why, God?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you just have\Nlet me die back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you make me live?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't God, at least not your God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the one who made you\Nlive, but I can change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Wehrmacht would like some information\Nfrom you before anything drastic happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are stubborn old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm smart enough to\Nknow that torture alone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would not give us what we want out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also know that you were penniless\Nwhen you first got to Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were nearly dead in the desert\Nwhen you found the oil fields
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would soon cause a massive\Noverhaul of the world's economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,German medicine is the greatest\Nthing in the world, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak and do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A truth serum?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What more could you possibly want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a history lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about Straizo\Nand about this Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us so that we can\Nfinally awaken the Pillar Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know the forces\Nyou're playing with!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's powerful enough to destroy us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make the necessary preparations\Nfor the blood-feeding experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't screw anything up!
