Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a proposal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and choose someone\Nfrom among yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need blood for a very\Nimportant historic experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you have all agreed on who will\Nbe the one to sacrifice his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:21:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will grant the rest of\Nyou your freedom immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I volunteer for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I do your experiment, you promise\Nthat you let everyone else go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are quite brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courage like yours is a thing that\Nmust be cultivated like a lush garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, we allow only the most fit to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set the boy aside and\Nexecute everyone else.
