Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.90,0:22:21.24,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.08,0:22:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.86,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.86,0:22:28.37,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.88,0:22:39.46,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.46,0:22:43.05,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.05,0:22:48.35,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.10,0:22:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it moaning, driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.35,0:22:50.97,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.97,0:22:55.02,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then all around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.02,0:22:57.40,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:23:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Milders come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.69,0:23:00.90,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.90,0:23:02.65,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.72,0:23:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over, we'll be\Nthere and we'll see you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.82,0:23:09.49,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten two summers, we'll be\Nthere and I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.25,0:23:15.92,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty four and five\Nmile over, we'll see you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.71,0:23:22.38,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.38,0:23:25.18,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,There with you
